***REMOVED*** Next Watch - Local Development Configuration
***REMOVED*** Copy this file to .env.local and customize for your environment

***REMOVED***=
***REMOVED*** DATABASE CONFIGURATION
***REMOVED***=
***REMOVED*** PostgreSQL connection for local development
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://your_username@localhost:5432/next_watch

***REMOVED***=
***REMOVED*** SECURITY SETTINGS
***REMOVED***=
***REMOVED*** JWT Secret - MUST match across all services
***REMOVED*** Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
JWT_SECRET=your-jwt-secret-here-change-in-production

***REMOVED***=
***REMOVED*** EXTERNAL API KEYS (OPTIONAL)
***REMOVED***=
***REMOVED*** TMDB API Access Token (for data import)
***REMOVED*** Get from: https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
***REMOVED*** TMDB_ACCESS_TOKEN=your-tmdb-access-token-here

***REMOVED*** OMDB API Key (for additional movie data)
***REMOVED*** Get from: http://www.omdbapi.com/apikey.aspx
***REMOVED*** OMDB_API_KEY=your-omdb-api-key-here

***REMOVED***=
***REMOVED*** SERVICE CONFIGURATION (Usually defaults are fine)
***REMOVED***=
***REMOVED*** REDIS_HOST=localhost
***REMOVED*** REDIS_PORT=6379
***REMOVED*** POSTGRES_HOST=localhost
***REMOVED*** POSTGRES_PORT=5432
